---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="About Us | SocioTool" description="Learn about SocioTool's mission to eliminate unit economics friction for e-commerce and digital businesses.">
  <main class="w-full max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 py-12 md:py-20 overflow-x-hidden">
    <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mb-6 tracking-tight transition-colors">About SocioTool</h1>
    
    <p class="text-base md:text-lg text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 leading-relaxed mb-6 transition-colors">
      We are engineering the definitive standard for calculating digital profit. SocioTool was built to solve a single, universal problem: <strong>Unit Economics friction.</strong>
    </p>

    <h2 class="text-xl md:text-2xl font-semibold text-slate-800 dark:text-slate-100 mt-8 mb-4 transition-colors">The Problem</h2>
    <p class="text-base md:text-lg text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 leading-relaxed mb-6 transition-colors">
      For too long, e-commerce founders, logistics managers, and media buyers have relied on fractured, outdated systems. The internet is littered with slow, bloated, and inaccurate calculators buried behind mandatory email sign-up walls and intrusive paywalls. Trying to calculate the exact impact of Stripe's $0.30 clip, Amazon's dimensional weight divisors, or Facebook's Break-even ROAS targets shouldn't require an advanced degree in spreadsheet architecture.
    </p>

    <h2 class="text-xl md:text-2xl font-semibold text-slate-800 dark:text-slate-100 mt-8 mb-4 transition-colors">Our Mission</h2>
    <p class="text-base md:text-lg text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 leading-relaxed mb-6 transition-colors">
      SocioTool exists to democratize financial clarity. We have engineered a unified, high-density catalog of 47+ lightning-fast, zero-friction utilities spanning e-commerce, logistics, and digital advertising. 
    </p>
    <p class="text-base md:text-lg text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 leading-relaxed mb-6 transition-colors">
      By executing complex rate-card math natively in the browser, we provide instantaneous, privacy-first answers to your most critical margin questions. No sign-ups. No data harvesting. Just raw, mathematical truth.
    </p>

    <h2 class="text-xl md:text-2xl font-semibold text-slate-800 dark:text-slate-100 mt-8 mb-4 transition-colors">Built for Speed</h2>
    <p class="text-base md:text-lg text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 leading-relaxed mb-6 transition-colors">
      Our platform is built on modern web infrastructure (Astro and React) to guarantee instantaneous load times and a highly responsive, mobile-first experience. Whether you are validating a dropshipping supplier on your phone or auditing an enterprise logistics contract on your desktop, SocioTool delivers answers at the speed of thought.
    </p>
  </main>
</Layout>
